      "body": "<!-- nemo-ci-review-impact:v1 ceiling=none -->\n\nLGTM. Removing the leading placeholders aligns generated-token scores and top-N entries with the [returned tokens](https://github.com/NVIDIA/Megatron-LM/blob/6807d6375224a9a2b5c8ebd6efd42c428fcc237b/megatron/core/inference/text_generation_server/dynamic_text_gen_server/endpoints/completions.py#L419-L442). The [regression test](https://github.com/NVIDIA/Megatron-LM/blob/6807d6375224a9a2b5c8ebd6efd42c428fcc237b/tests/unit_tests/inference/test_completions.py#L328-L413) checks both arrays and JSON clamping while retaining the existing echo cases. I found no qualifying issues in the light review. Static inspection only; I didn't run tests.\n\n> **Note:** formal approval is not available for this request, so this review is posted as a comment only.\n\n*Review generated by codex. This was a full review. Request a full review with `/review reset=true`.*\n\n<!-- nemo-ci-review-rendering:inline-v1 -->\n<!-- nemo-ci-formal-review:7a25b9b52d15d297af14c1648ade721ec65db862fd584f8b405dd1cb875afb57:a65fd1739c3216a2a88327d9556783105d34b5cdfdb4b5fd40091321b0deec46 -->",
